      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Girls who like to laugh."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：你喜欢长发的还是短发的？",
      "traditional": "小雨：你喜歡長髮的還是短髮的？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ xǐ huan cháng fà de hái shi duǎn fà de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Do you like long hair or short hair?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：长发的。",
      "traditional": "本：長髮的。",
      "pinyin": "běn cháng fà de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Long hair."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：那你喜欢单眼皮的还是双眼皮的？",
      "traditional": "小雨：那你喜歡單眼皮的還是雙眼皮的？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nà nǐ xǐ huan dān yǎn pí de hái shi shuāng yǎn pí de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Do you like single eyelid or double eyelid?"
    },
    {
